msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "526796"
msgid "Ahh!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "527208"
msgid "Eliza, watch out!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527244"
msgid "I dash off towards #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527364"
msgid "Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527376"
msgid "Master!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527388"
msgid "#RUBSMaster#RUBEDear#REND―!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527444"
msgid "Ouch………\nSeems I fell over from the blast."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527904"
msgid "Mmn… ugh…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "527972"
msgid "………hm? Between my arms?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528000"
msgid "Huh…… I'm…………\n……why did you…………?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528232"
msgid "Umm, err… good morning…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528752"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528768"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528784"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528800"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528816"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528832"
msgid "………………"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528848"
msgid "…half of that happened, right?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528884"
msgid "She's half-asleep.\nFUUULLLYYY half-asleep."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "528932"
msgid "And when she hears about this later,\nI bet she'll smash her head against the wall\nin embarrassment―――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529052"
msgid "She may be our enemy,\nbut I can't bear to let her embarrass herself further.\nShe's still staring at me, deluded. I say to her,\n\"Snap out of it! Wake up!\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529312"
msgid "Enemies… you and I…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529384"
msgid "………………………………………………\n………………………………………………\n……………………………………*thump*"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529496"
msgid "――――What?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529512"
msgid "Wait, uhh……………… what……?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "529992"
msgid "E-everyone!\nUmm, err, well… What's done is done,\nso how about just a bonk on the head…?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "530760"
msgid "And here it is………\nSo this is how everyone felt back with\nmy first #C000246204SG#CDEF…"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "531192"
msgid "I know what your secret is――!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "531540"
msgid "Lovestruck!"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "531568"
msgid "Cinderella!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "531764"
msgid "O' possessor of whipped cream filled thoughts\nand a heartburn inducing mind:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532040"
msgid "…Miss #C236196003Tohsaka#CDEF, please don't smash the keyboard.\nI suppose I'll have to specify the #C000246204SG#CDEF's name."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532256"
msgid "\"Cinderella\"! How's that!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532288"
msgid "She's no neglected princess, she'd be the evil\nstep sister at best!\nThat's like calling #C236196003Julius#CDEF a prince!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "532556"
msgid "Uck-no way, that can't……… …aaah!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533492"
msgid "I see. So that's what she desires…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "533688"
msgid "Well done, #[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF.\nFinish your exploration and return via the\ncheckpoint."
msgstr ""

