#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575720"
msgid "After making a shortcut to the old school from\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF, please return to base."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575824"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF, you appear to have accumulated\na lot of fatigue. I recommend that\nyou return for the moment to take a rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "575960"
msgid "I'm concerned about #C236196003Rin#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576004"
msgid "Searching the Labyrinth is nice and all,\nbut I should #C000246204return to the old school#CDEF to\nbriefly speak with #C236196003Kiara#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576144"
msgid "I obtained the first #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nLet's briefly return to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and sort\nout the situation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576264"
msgid "First thing to do is activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nThat'll help move our search along."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576364"
msgid "We took more damage from our fight with #C236196003Lancer#CDEF\nthan I expected. Now would be a good time to head\nback to the old school.\nLuckily, there's a #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF near us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576556"
msgid "What's wrong, Praetor?\nLet's #C000246204continue onward#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576620"
msgid "Don't worry. I'll protect you, Darling.\nSo, continue on #C000246204ahead#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576700"
msgid "Surely you're not telling me that you're\nfrightened? Even you understand that stopping\nhere is impermissible, yes?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576816"
msgid "#C236196003#FAMILY#CDEF. After you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nplease have yourself a rest in your\nprivate room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576944"
msgid "Even in cyberspace, you need proper rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "576988"
msgid "Once you activate the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF,\nuse it to get back here.\nI'll bet you're exhausted, #C236196003#NICK#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577116"
msgid "#[Mr.][Ms.]##C236196003 #NICK#CDEF, return to base for now.\nLet's discuss our plan\nin the #C000246204Student Council Room#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577244"
msgid "#C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF, please come back.\nYou've accumulated a lot of fatigue;\nany more will be dangerous!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577352"
msgid "#C236196003Sakura#CDEF's worried state gets across to\nme even over the transmission."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577440"
msgid "She's right, it would be best if\nwe returned to the #C000246204Old School Building#CDEF."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577532"
msgid "We obtained the #C000246204SG#CDEF. Let's return to the\n#C000246204Old School Building#CDEF for the time being.\nWe can come again after we recover."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577680"
msgid "We got the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nMission complete.\nLet's head home and get some rest."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577764"
msgid "Where are you going? We secured the #C000246204SG#CDEF.\nThere's nothing urgent to tend to.\nBack to #C000246204My Room#CDEF, now."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577896"
msgid "Hrrrm? Where are you going, #C236196003#FAMILY\n#GIVEN#CDEF? Where are you going,\nleaving me behind?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "577996"
msgid "For a second there, I was thinking about\nleaving #C236196003Gatou#CDEF and heading back,\nbut it probably won't rest easy on my conscience,\nso let's turn back."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578156"
msgid "Wait, Praetor. If we're going to head back,\nit'll behoove us for the future to have\nthe #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF activated."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578284"
msgid "Master, let's look for the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nIt should be around here somewhere…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578376"
msgid "We don't need to walk all the way back.\nWe can use the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF to reach the\nold school in a flash. Very nifty."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578508"
msgid "M-my stomach is at its limit…\nI want to hurry back to #C000246204My Room#CDEF and get some rest…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578608"
msgid "Before we go to the next floor,\nlet's #C000246204head back to the Student Council Room#CDEF.\nWe need to hand over the data we got from #C236196003Green Archer#CDEF.\nHe gave his life to entrust us with it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578816"
msgid "Huh? You're still in the #C000246204Sakura Labyrinth#CDEF?\nCome on, there's nothing to do there.\nGet your butt back here!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "578940"
msgid "We'll talk about what comes next tomorrow,\nso #C000246204come back and get some rest#CDEF.\nAfter, drop by the Student Council Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579072"
msgid "We're in a race against time.\nWe need to hurry to the #C000246204Moon Cell's Core#CDEF――!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579164"
msgid "I can't let #C236196003Shinji#CDEF's hopes go to waste.\nLet's press on so we can catch up to #C236196003Meltlilith#CDEF!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579288"
msgid "Praetor, I've grown tired. Let us return\nto My Room and have ourselves a bath."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579368"
msgid "I know how you feel, but knowing\nwhen to rest is also part of the battle.\nLet's head back to My Room."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579472"
msgid "Darling, now is the time for rest.\nLet's return to our room and\nrecover our strength."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "579560"
msgid "What an impatient #[man][woman]#. Laboring away\nis not all there is to life, you know?\nWhen it's time to rest, rest."
msgstr ""

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579680"
msgid "You may now save your current game data\n            as #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."
msgstr "Agora você pode salvar seus dados\n         como #C000246204Clear Data#CDEF."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579764"
msgid "     You may use this data to carry\nover elements to the start of a new game."
msgstr "     Você pode usar esses dados para levar\nelementos ao início de um novo jogo."

#. unk_op1650
msgctxt "579844"
msgid "Please be careful to not overwrite\n  the data while you are saving."
msgstr "Tome cuidado para não sobrescrever\n  os dados ao salvar."

#. unk_op1653
msgctxt "579912"
msgid "Would you like to save your Clear Data?"
msgstr "Deseja salvar seus Clear Data?"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line1
msgctxt "579952"
msgid "Are you sure you wish to exit"
msgstr "Tem certeza de que deseja sair"

#. popupSaveBeforeQuit_line2
msgctxt "579984"
msgid "without saving the Clear Data?"
msgstr "sem salvar os Clear Data?"

#. popupStd
msgctxt "580016"
msgid "Continue to the next floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580044"
msgid "Continue to the next floor."
msgstr ""

#. popupStd
msgctxt "580072"
msgid "Return to the previous floor?"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580104"
msgid "Return to previous floor."
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "580132"
msgid "Return to the old school."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580160"
msgid "I'm so glad you could make it, #[piggy][squirrely]#!\nAre you ready to enjoy my special concert!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580260"
msgid "Here, in what appears to be the\nfurthest portion of this floor,\nan eager #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF and semi-impatient #C236196003Shinji#CDEF\nwere waiting for us."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580424"
msgid "Between the two of them,\nsomething is exuding a fierce presence―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580496"
msgid "Its basic exterior looks no different than\nthe enemies deployed on the Hill of Hell."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580584"
msgid "But I'm getting a bad feeling about it."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580624"
msgid "Huh… the hell do you mean, \"special concert\"?\nDon't you get it? I prepped this guy\nso we can hide you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580728"
msgid "So why did you come out anyway? Did my words go\nin one ear and out the other? Is there actually\na birdbrain in that dragon head?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "580860"
msgid "You're the dumb one here, #C236196003Shinji#CDEF. Letting anyone\nother than me have the limelight in my Labyrinth\nis disrespectful to my audience."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581008"
msgid "Victory doesn't end merely with your opponent's\ndefeat. A noble makes them prostrate both their\nbody and mind, then stomps all over them."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581148"
msgid "A rat like you probably can't understand\nsuch etiquette… but no matter.\nI'll make an exception, just this once."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581264"
msgid "This golem can shoot out of lots of flashy\nlaser beams and stuff, right? Then I'll do you\nthe favor of using it for my opening act."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581396"
msgid "My first song will be flashy, anyhow. Openings\nneed to hit it off with electrifying rock―――\nThat's the tried-and-true rule for concerts!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581536"
msgid "Ohhh, is that right?\nThen I'll let you have the floor first,\nbut don't say I didn't warn you, after."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581640"
msgid "That's #RUBS       the favorite's#RUBEbecause your#REND chance to shine\nprobably won't even come!\n――――get 'em, #C000246204Shinji Tank#CDEF!!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581788"
msgid "We beat it. Beat it a little too hard."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581828"
msgid "It all ended with a blow from #C236196003#SVT#CDEF.\nThe #C000246204Shinji Tank#CDEF stopped moving and became silent."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "581948"
msgid "I knew it… They've greatly flourished since\nwe last fought. …so THIS is the strength\nthat #[boy][girl]# had…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582060"
msgid "…this isn't―you're kidding me…!\nHow did #C236196003#GIVEN#CDEF of all people get\nTHIS strong…!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582160"
msgid "Hey, #C000246204Shinji Tank#CDEF! Move! Move, damn it!\nShit. You hunk of scrap!\nYou're making me look bad!!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582268"
msgid "―――At that moment, the giant that one would\nexpect to have ceased begins ominously vibrating."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582368"
msgid "…how do I describe #[his][her]# growth…? \"Pigs rise to\nthe top.\" …that's not how it goes…\n……huh? What? What's going on?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582496"
msgid "#C236196003Shinji#CDEF backs off, leaving only #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF,\nwho hasn't caught on to what's happening."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582612"
msgid "Meanwhile, the #C000246204Shinji Tank#CDEF's shaking\ngrows increasingly intense."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582696"
msgid "I don't know what's causing it.\nI don't know how to stop it.\nThe only thing I do know is that at this rate,\nit's going to explode."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582828"
msgid "The moment I sensed that, I acted immediately―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "582880"
msgid "We still need her SG!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582904"
msgid "I reach for her petite body at the same\ntime I sense the explosion behind her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "582984"
msgid "What the hell are you doing!?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583016"
msgid "With my entire body in pain,\nI instinctively call #C236196003Sakura#CDEF.\nIs #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF still in one piece?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583144"
msgid "O-okay! You only have some bruises,\nscratches, and light burns―――\nIt doesn't look… life-threatening…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583252"
msgid "………?\nShe's not being completely straight with me.\nAm I in bad shape somehow?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583332"
msgid "Now that I think about, I feel a little warm.\nDon't tell me I'm bleedin―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583412"
msgid "An intense flash of light disoriented me,\nso I blink a few times.\nThe blurry world rushes back into focus."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583520"
msgid "I suddenly hear a faint moaning\ncoming from between my arms."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583584"
msgid "Having grasped the situation faster than me,\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's jade green eyes grew wide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583684"
msgid "But her eyes continue to dazzle,\nreflecting #C236196003#FAMILY #GIVEN#CDEF's face as she\nstares blankly."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583792"
msgid "…good morning, darling. So listen, I had\nthe strangest dream. If I tell you, will you\npromise not to laugh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "583904"
msgid "You and I were enemies and fought. In the end,\nI had you cornered, but a huge rat next to\nme blew up out of nowhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584024"
msgid "I thought it was over for me. The blast was\ngoing to tear us apart, but you pulled my\nhand close and said:"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584132"
msgid "\"You don't deserve to explode. And if some\ntank of oil spills on you, it would be a sin. By\nthe way, your horns are electrifyingly cute.\""
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584272"
msgid "Ahh… You were so sensual and cool,\nI could've just sank my teeth into your neck\nright then and there…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584376"
msgid "We actually ARE enemies.\nThere actually WAS an explosion.\nYou're just confused from getting hit on the head…!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584488"
msgid "That means this is… forbidden love………?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584532"
msgid "…hm. Your lack of fidelity is quite something.\nI could never hate one who understands love―\nNever, but… enough! I'm starting to sulk!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584672"
msgid "Do you not have the capacity to learn?\n#[You did the exact same thing][You know, this also happened]# 5 floors ago."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584788"
msgid "Why, of course we can add your reservation～!\nNow get behind me, Darling.\nWe don't have to kill her just yet."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584900"
msgid "You fool, could it be?\nAre you the pick-up artist\nwho only goes for the crazy women?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "584988"
msgid "All hail the mighty architect of setting flags.\nHow about you off yourself already?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585072"
msgid "I propose developing an emotion restraint\ndevice, a \"Flag Breaker.\"\nHere is my documentation."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585168"
msgid "My heart is being mercilessly broken by everyone's cold stares.\nThis isn't―isn't what it looks like.\nIt's all a misunderstanding, a misunderstanding…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585320"
msgid "In other news, putting my emotional scars aside,\nmy restless hand is indicating that a secret is manifesting."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585432"
msgid "Best if I keep this up and draw things out――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585480"
msgid "The moment I had that idea,\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's blank eyes fiercely open wide."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585568"
msgid "………HUH!?\nW-what are you doing, you lowly farm animal!?\nGet away from me! Get AWAY!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585656"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF, apparently having came to her senses, flails at me.\nI hurry off of her so I don't get kicked."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585780"
msgid "She stood up, face beet red, and went\nstraight to tidying up her hair and skirt.\n…while stealing occasional glances at me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "585904"
msgid "H-how dare you save me!\nI've never felt the humiliation of being saved\nby a #[piggy][squirrely]# before!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586012"
msgid "Look at me! My cheeks are flushing red!\nIt's proof that my rage is at an all-time high!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586100"
msgid "Even my heart is beating,\n\"I'll never forgive you for this!\"\nThis means my victory is assured!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586196"
msgid "Now that I'm furious, I WON'T reveal my secrets!\nThe only thing you'll reach is an impasse!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586288"
msgid "#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF declares her victory.\nHowever, as if refuting that claim, my hand throbs even more."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586400"
msgid "Y-y-y-you're talking out of your ass!\nMaybe someone like #C236196003Rin#CDEF would fall for that,\nbut you won't trick me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586524"
msgid "There's no way someone like YOU would\nunderstand my mind!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586584"
msgid "Then this #[piggy][squirrely]# is going to show her\njust how sure about it #[he][she]# is."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586676"
msgid "I get the impression that she's easy;\nshe falls head over heels in a flash.\nShe's unmistakably―――"
msgstr ""

#. choice
msgctxt "586780"
msgid "Extremely self-conscious!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586808"
msgid "She's forever a maiden, prone to being lovestruck."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "586860"
msgid "Cursed to interpret trivial encounters#ROFS-003#RUBS the work of destiny#RUBE as romance#REND:\nto see princes, white horses, and roses everywhere."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587008"
msgid "Her dreams are mellifluous.\nShe has \"loves to fall in love\" syndrome."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587080"
msgid "――――Thy name is #ROFS0002#RUBS    Sweets#RUBELovestruck#REND!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587148"
msgid "You think you can HIDE this!?!?\nYou're wrong, anyway!\nI'm not going to forget this so easily!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587244"
msgid "I think I recall having seen a secret\nlike this on the first floor.\nBut since there's no way it can be exactly the same…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587368"
msgid "I don't think it's entirely wrong.\n…still, it's #C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's #C000246204SG#CDEF that we want\nto know right now. Its correct name is…"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587520"
msgid "You're spot on!\nNot surprising, she did target YOU!\nKeep going and wrap this up!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587604"
msgid "The #C000246204SG#CDEF transferred! The Shield is opening!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587664"
msgid "I hear sounds of the floor being opened up."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587708"
msgid "After revealing a secret that certainly fits how she looks,\n#C236196003Elizabeth#CDEF's #ROFS0002#RUBS    Ego     #RUBEoffshoot#REND begins cracking and crumbling."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587872"
msgid "Huff… huff…\nLooks like you really like insider stories\non idols, too, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "587952"
msgid "With an expression of ecstasy, she bares her fangs.\nPerhaps this expression is a lingering vestige of the\nsecret that was drawn out of her."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588092"
msgid "But I see, this is the way I am…\nThese are my true feelings… I've always longed\nto have love like in romance stories―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588220"
msgid "Thank you. Now I'm aware of it.\nAnd now say hello to the new, wonderful me!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588296"
msgid "Yes! If torture is my one and only amusement,\nthen to be in LOVE is my one and only dream!\nWhen I think of love, I get more beautiful!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588432"
msgid "Being in love sustains one's beauty,\nand beauty sustains being in love.\nAhh, what a sweet, infinite loop!"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588540"
msgid "What was I thinking?\nI can't be getting all smitten over cattle.\nBut―――"
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588616"
msgid "It's fine. I HAVE gone mad, after all.\nI'm going to bestow a special honor\nto little, ugly you."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588712"
msgid "―――I've reserved your soul for myself.\nLaud me and my pinnacled beauty―from the\nclosest place next to me."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588824"
msgid "Looks like trouble is coming our way again."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588868"
msgid "Now that's a surprise.\nNo matter. I'll be snuffing her out, anyway."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "588936"
msgid "So, there you have it. Prepare some\nflowery words that degenerate dragon might\nlike while you have the chance."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589048"
msgid "#C236196003Rani#CDEF's voice suddenly brings me back to my senses."
msgstr ""

#. backlog,motion,text
msgctxt "589116"
msgid "The maiden disintegrated.\nOnly thing left to do is find the #C000246204checkpoint#CDEF.\nNo point in pushing ourselves any more today.\nLet's just quietly head back to the school building."
msgstr ""

